Output demo.mp4

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 36
Set Width 2400
Set Height 1440
Set Padding 48
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms

Hide
Env NO_COLOR ""
Env TERM "xterm-256color"
Env COLORTERM "truecolor"
Type "source sandbox.sh"
Enter
Sleep 15s
Show

Sleep 200ms
Type "lopper ~/code"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 3.2s

Type "s"
Sleep 800ms
Type "/merged"
Enter
Up@30ms 11
Sleep 800ms
Space@450ms 4
Escape
Sleep 600ms

Type "/uncommitted"
Enter
Up@30ms 11
Sleep 800ms
Space@450ms 2
Escape
Sleep 1.5s

Type "d"
Sleep 3.5s
Enter

Wait+Screen@20s /freed/
Sleep 5.5s
